keywords Darkspear Raiders, Theramore Expeditionary Force, Darkspear Islands, Merchant Coast, Northwatch Hold, Nizook Boof, Creeg Bothunk, Brelinda McFarry, Bryanna Embreeze, Darkspear Islands Mark of Honor, Conflict at Darkspear Islands, Darkspear Islands Clash, The Battle for Darkspear Islands, Darkspear Battle Tabard, Theramore Battle Tabard, Master of Darkspear Islands, Legacy Point
