why Forever's new battleground: its gear comes for every bracket from 30, and Exalted gives a Legacy Point.

# Darkspear Raiders (2798, Horde) and Theramore Expeditionary Force (2799,
# Alliance): Forever's new 15 against 15 battleground, for levels 30-60. Its
# rules and bases are Blizzard's (four capture points and a flag in the
# middle, first team to 2000 points; the bases at the Merchant Coast and
# Northwatch with a portal in, quests and the quartermaster). The quests,
# their reputation and objectives are from Forever's quest data (quest
# pages); the quartermasters' stock from Forever's NPC data, the Forever
# client's item table and the game's sniffed item updates (prices before any
# standing discount). Exalted with either faction is the Legacy Challenge
# "Master of Darkspear Islands" (one account-wide Legacy Point).
#
# Forever's data gives a giver only to the level 30-39 quests (Nizook Boof,
# Brelinda McFarry, the Warbringer and the Brigadier General); the 40-49,
# 50-59 and 60 versions have none, so the guide names the same givers for
# them. Only the 30-39 repeat of the mark quest is in the data (98888, 98896).
# ASSUMED: the higher brackets have their own repeat at the same 100 (Classic
# flow for the other battlegrounds; Forever's data has no quest for it).
# In-game check: the Warbringer at level 60 after Conflict at Darkspear Islands.
# Brelinda McFarry has no place in Forever's data; her quest text puts her at
# Northwatch Hold. ASSUMED: beside Bryanna Embreeze (63.4,58.7). In-game
# check: where she stands.
# ASSUMED: 3 Marks of Honor for a win and 1 for a loss (Classic flow for the
# other battlegrounds; a beta report says the same). In-game check: marks
# after a game.
# INGAME: how much reputation a game pays by itself (Forever has published
# no battleground reputation rates).
# INGAME: the Exalted tabard questline (Blizzard names it; Forever's data has
# no quest for it yet).
# The care package quests (98910-98915) need Friendly and give 10 League of
# Arathor or Defilers reputation on Forever's quest pages; they have no giver
# in the data and are left to a note.

step Merchant Coast
  only Horde
  when level<40
  tip The Darkspear Islands lie off the coast of Dustwallow Marsh: 15 against 15, from level 30. Hold the four capture points to gain points, faster the more you hold, and carry the flag from the middle to a base your team holds for more; the first team to 2000 points wins. The sea kills: cross on the bridges. Queue at any battlemaster or step through the portal here at the Merchant Coast, north of Ratchet. Nizook Boof pays 200 reputation for your first win. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk adds up to 10% to every number in this guide.
  accept 98906
  turnin 98906                         -- after a win

