step Horde Warbringer
  only Horde
  when level<40
  tip The Horde Warbringer pays 150 reputation for 3 Darkspear Islands Marks of Honor the first time (Conflict at Darkspear Islands), then 100 for every 3 more. The nearest stand at Mor'shan in the north of the Barrens and in Orgrimmar; others in Thunder Bluff and the Undercity, at Hammerfall and by the Alterac Valley gate. Forever's PvP gear also costs Marks of Honor along with honor: decide what you want before you hand them in. You can carry at most 30 Darkspear Islands marks: hand in or spend them before you reach that.
  accept 98887
  collect 274895 x3 quest 98887.1 @65,35  -- Darkspear Islands Marks of Honor: play games
  turnin 98887

