step Darkspear Raiders to Friendly
  only Horde
  tip Neutral to Friendly is 3000 reputation. Forever has not said how much a game pays by itself; the sure part is the Warbringer's 100 for every 3 marks, which is one win, so at most 30 wins from Neutral even before the games' own reputation. Each new bracket (40, 50, 60) brings a new first win for Nizook Boof (200) and a new first mark quest (150).
  talk 15350 optional                  -- Horde Warbringer: Conflict at Darkspear Islands again, 100 for 3 marks
  rep 2798 Friendly

step Darkspear Raiders to Honored
  only Horde
  tip Friendly to Honored is 6000 reputation. Friendly opens the first rewards at Creeg Bothunk, the quartermaster beside Nizook Boof: the trinkets Darkspear Voodoo Seal and Relentless Raider's Seal for levels 33 and 48 (1g49s to 11g85s), and food, bandages and draughts for the battleground (5s to 20s). A Darkspear care package for Friendly also exists in Forever's data.
  talk 263570 optional                 -- Creeg Bothunk: Friendly rewards
  talk 15350 optional                  -- Horde Warbringer: 100 for 3 marks
  rep 2798 Honored

step Darkspear Raiders to Revered
  only Horde
  tip Honored to Revered is 12000 reputation. Honored opens Insurgent's Band, Darkspear Signet, Darkspear Warding Pendant and Darkspear Raider's Cloak for levels 28, 38, 48 and 58 (1g11s to 12g6s): rings, neck and cloak that fit the bracket you are in.
  talk 263570 optional                 -- Creeg Bothunk: Honored rewards
  talk 15350 optional                  -- Horde Warbringer: 100 for 3 marks
  rep 2798 Revered

step Darkspear Raiders to Exalted
  only Horde
  tip Revered to Exalted is 21000 reputation, half the climb. Revered opens the weapons for levels 28, 38, 48 and 58: Darkspear Raider's Reaper (two-handed axe), Darkspear Insurgent's Spellblade (dagger), Darkspear Skirmisher's Bludgeon (mace) and the Tome of the Darkspear Prophecy (off-hand), 1g44s to 37g15s.
  talk 263570 optional                 -- Creeg Bothunk: Revered rewards
  talk 15350 optional                  -- Horde Warbringer: 100 for 3 marks
  rep 2798 Exalted

step Creeg Bothunk
  only Horde
  tip Exalted gives the Legacy Point "Master of Darkspear Islands" and opens the epics: gloves in plate, mail, leather and cloth for levels 50 and 60 (Raider Gauntlets, Gloves, Handguards and Handwraps, 3g94s to 15g16s) and level 60 shoulders in every armor type (Darkspear Pauldrons, Shoulders, Spaulders, Mantle, Epaulets, Shoulderpads and Shoulderguards, 9g44s to 16g86s). The Darkspear Battle Tabard comes from a short questline that Exalted opens here.
  talk 263570                          -- Creeg Bothunk: Exalted rewards

